      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Graphics interface rendering command wrapper.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load command and six argument values from stack parameters\n2. Retrieve global graphics interface pointer from g_pGfxInterface\n3. Dereference virtual method table offset 0x7c\n4. Execute rendering command with loaded arguments\n5. Return to caller with stack frame cleanup\n\nParameters:\n- dwReserved1 (uint): Reserved stack parameter 1\n- dwReserved2 (uint): Reserved stack parameter 2\n- dwCmd (uint): Rendering command identifier passed to graphics subsystem\n- dwArg1 (uint): Command argument 1\n- dwArg2 (uint): Command argument 2\n- dwArg3 (uint): Command argument 3\n- dwArg4 (uint): Command argument 4\n- dwArg5 (uint): Command argument 5\n- dwArg6 (uint): Command argument 6\n\nReturns:\n- void: No explicit return value",
