      "name": "ValidateAndExecuteHandlers",
      "signature": "void ValidateAndExecuteHandlers(dword dwHandler, LPSTR szErrorBuf, int nMaxLength)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Validate error handler and execute if available.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if handler list is initialized\n2. Iterate through registered handlers until one succeeds\n3. On success, return immediately\n4. On all failures, copy default error message to buffer\n\nParameters:\n- dwHandler: Handler ID to validate\n- szErrorBuf (LPSTR): Buffer to receive error message (LPSTR)\n- nMaxLength: Maximum buffer length in bytes\n\nReturns:\n- void (result stored in EAX for success/failure check)",
