      "name": "DisplayGfxError",
      "signature": "bool DisplayGfxError(uint dwParam)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Displays graphics initialization error dialog.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calls FUN_6faa5053 to format base message based on dwParam\n2. Formats message with wvsprintfA using stack arguments\n3. Shows MessageBoxA with title \"D2Gfx DLL\" and Yes/No/Cancel buttons (0x2011)\n4. Returns true if user clicked No (button 2), false otherwise\n\nParameters:\n- dwParam (uint): Error code passed to FUN_6faa5053\n\nReturns:\n- true if user clicked No, false for other responses",
