      "name": "CallSettingFrameWithExceptionHandler",
      "signature": "dword CallSettingFrameWithExceptionHandler(void * pData, dword dwUnknown, void * pCallback, int nParam1, int nParam2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Wrapper function that calls __CallSettingFrame@12 with SEH (Structured Exception Handling) frame setup.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Set up SEH frame by saving current ExceptionList to local stack variable (pPrevExceptionList)\n  2. Link new exception frame: FS:[0] = &local_18 (pPrevExceptionList)\n  3. Increment param_4 (nParam1) by 1 and save to local variable (nIncrementedParam)\n  4. Copy param_2 and param_3 to locals for exception frame context\n  5. Store frame handler address (0x6fb99e26) in local_14 (pFrameHandler)\n  6. Call __CallSettingFrame@12 with (pCallback, pData, nParam2)\n  7. Restore previous ExceptionList from saved value to unwind SEH frame\n  8. Return result from __CallSettingFrame@12 call (dVar1 - compiler SSA temporary)\n\nParameters:\n  void *pData - Data context pointer passed to exception handler and __CallSettingFrame@12\n  dword dwUnknown - Unknown flag/count value, copied to locals but not directly used in call\n  void *pCallback - Callback function pointer passed to __CallSettingFrame@12\n  int nParam1 - Parameter incremented by 1, stored in nIncrementedParam local\n  int nParam2 - Final parameter passed to __CallSettingFrame@12\n\nReturns:\n  dword - Result from __CallSettingFrame@12 (success/error code)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Uses x86 SEH via FS:[0x0] register to save/restore exception list chain\n  - Exception frame is properly unwound before return to ensure correct exception handling\n  - Magic value 0x6fb99e26: Frame handler function address for SEH unwinding\n  - Calling convention: __cdecl (stack parameters, caller cleanup)\n  - Note: Function uses 1 compiler-generated SSA temporary (dVar1) optimized away\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Offset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n  -0x18  | 4    | pPrevExceptionList | void * | Previous ExceptionList pointer for SEH chain\n  -0x14  | 4    | pFrameHandler | void * | Frame handler address (0x6fb99e26)\n  -0x10  | 4    | dwParam2Saved | dword | Copy of param_2 (dwUnknown)\n  -0xc   | 4    | dwParam2Copy | dword | Another copy of param_2 for exception context\n  -0x8   | 4    | nIncrementedParam | int | param_4 + 1\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - __CallSettingFrame@12(0x6fb9c0a0) - Core function called with exception frame setup\n  - FUN_6fb9bd08 - Caller that initiates this exception-wrapped call",
