      "name": "InitializeCodePageLocale",
      "signature": "undefined4 InitializeCodePageLocale(int param_1)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes the code page locale tables for character type classification.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Acquire critical section 0x19 for thread safety\n2. Resolve the requested code page identifier via ResolveCodePageIdentifier\n3. If resolved code page matches current g_dwCurrentCodePage, return 0 (no change needed)\n4. If code page is 0 (invalid), call InitializeLocaleDataBuffers and retry\n5. Search g_aCodePageInfoTable for matching code page entry (48-byte stride, 5 entries max)\n6. If found in table: use cached character type ranges from table\n7. If not found: call GetCPInfo to get CPINFO structure, then:\n   - Clear g_abCharacterTypeTable (256 bytes + 1)\n   - Parse CPINFO.LeadByte ranges to set character type flags\n   - Set flags 0x08 for single-byte characters (1-254)\n8. Update g_dwCurrentCodePage, g_fIsMultiByteCodePage, g_aLeadByteRanges\n9. Call MapCodePageIdentifier and InitializeCharacterTables\n10. Release critical section and return result\n\nParameters:\n    dwCodePageId - Code page identifier to initialize (e.g., 932 for Shift-JIS, 936 for GBK)\n\nReturns:\n    0  - Code page unchanged (already current)\n    1  - Code page successfully initialized\n    -1 - Initialization failed (g_dwCodePageInitialized was 0)\n\nCharacter Type Flags (g_abCharacterTypeTable):\n    0x01 - First byte of 2-byte range 1\n    0x02 - First byte of 2-byte range 2\n    0x04 - First byte of 2-byte range 3\n    0x08 - Single-byte character (default for 1-254)\n\nStructure Layout (g_aCodePageInfoTable entries, 48 bytes each):\n    Offset  Size  Field           Description\n    0x00    4     dwCodePage      Code page identifier\n    0x04    2     wLeadByte1Min   Lead byte range 1 minimum\n    0x06    2     wLeadByte1Max   Lead byte range 1 maximum\n    0x08    24    abCharRanges    Character type range definitions\n    0x10    4     dwFlags         Code page properties\n    0x20    8     reserved        Padding to 48-byte boundary",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
