      "name": "InitializeVideoSettings",
      "signature": "void InitializeVideoSettings(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes video display settings (contrast and gamma) from registry.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Query contrast value from registry (default 100)\n2. Reset Ordinal_10042 settings\n3. Query gamma value from registry (default 0x9b)\n4. Store gamma to global and apply via Ordinal_10018\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: Registry keys at s_Diablo_II_6faae04c\n\nReturns:\n- void (always succeeds)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04b",
