      "name": "FilterCppException",
      "signature": "int FilterCppException(uint * * ppExceptionRecord)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Filter C++ exception based on exception code in exception record\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Dereference ppExceptionRecord to get EXCEPTION_RECORD pointer\n2. Read ExceptionCode field (first DWORD of EXCEPTION_RECORD structure)\n3. Compare against C++ exception magic number 0xE06D7363\n4. If match: Jump to SetupStructuredExceptionHandler for C++ handling\n5. If no match: Return 0 (EXCEPTION_CONTINUE_SEARCH)\n\nParameters:\n  ppExceptionRecord - Pointer to pointer to EXCEPTION_RECORD structure\n                      First dereference yields the EXCEPTION_RECORD*\n                      Second dereference reads ExceptionCode field\n\nReturns:\n  0 (EXCEPTION_CONTINUE_SEARCH) - Not a C++ exception, continue search\n  Does not return normally for C++ exceptions - jumps to SEH handler\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0xE06D7363 - Microsoft C++ exception magic ('msc' | 0xE0000000)\n               Indicates exception thrown by MSVC++ runtime\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Uses tail call optimization (JMP instead of CALL) for C++ path\n  - extraout_EAX is phantom variable from JMP, not actual local",
