      "name": "IsCppException",
      "signature": "bool IsCppException(int * pExceptionPointers)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Checks if the given exception is a C++ exception thrown by MSVC runtime.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Dereference exception pointers to get exception record\n2. Check exception code for MSVC C++ signature (0xE06D7363 = \"msc\")\n3. Verify parameter count is 3 (standard C++ exception)\n4. Check ABI signature (0x19930520 = May 20, 1993 C++ exception spec date)\n5. Verify ThrowInfo pointer is NULL (offset 0x1C)\n6. Return 1 if all checks pass, 0 otherwise\n\nParameters:\npExceptionPointers - Pointer to EXCEPTION_POINTERS structure containing exception context\n\nReturns:\n1 (TRUE) if exception is a valid MSVC C++ exception\n0 (FALSE) otherwise\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0xE06D7363 - MSVC C++ exception code (\"msc\" in ASCII + 0xE0000000)\n0x19930520 - C++ exception ABI version date (May 20, 1993)\n0x3 - Expected parameter count for C++ exceptions\n\nStructure Layout (EXCEPTION_RECORD at offset 0 of EXCEPTION_POINTERS):\nOffset  Size  Field              Description\n0x00    4     ExceptionCode      Exception identifier (0xE06D7363 for C++)\n0x10    4     NumberParameters   Parameter count (must be 3)\n0x14    4     magicNumber        ABI signature (0x19930520)\n0x1C    4     pThrowInfo         ThrowInfo pointer (NULL check)",
